  m_text: Help Shade reach the astrolabe. After a certain number of moves, time is
    reversed and your past self appears, making the same moves that you did. The
    past self move the same time as you, till it reaches the limit of moves, after
    which it stops. Make use of this to your advantage and reach the objective. However,
    make sure that Shade and his past self does not meet, for it will cause a paradox
    and lead to a game over.
